Portrait segmentation model
===========================

The selfie multiclass segmentation model is distributed by the MediaPipe team.

Model: selfie_multiclass_256x256.tflite
Upstream model card:
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/image_segmenter/selfie_multiclass_256x256/float32/latest/selfie_multiclass_256x256.tflite

The model is provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright 2023 The MediaPipe Authors.

The application downloads the model at build time and verifies its SHA-256 digest
before packaging it. The model is not checked into this repository.
